        "Description": "Beneath Sapienza’s lies a clandestine laboratory run by The Obsidian Circle.\r\rHidden behind layers of secrecy, its scientists are developing a highly contagious engineered virus capable of devastating entire populations within days. Intelligence suggests the project is nearing completion.\r\rEliminate the head of the medical division along with her senior assistants to ensure the virus never leaves the laboratory.",
